      "severity": "medium",
      "category": "configuration",
      "description": "A compressed or unreadable archive (gzip, xz, bzip2, zstd, lz4, zip, 7z, or a tar past the scan bounds) is committed beside the PKGBUILD and named by source=(). makepkg extracts it and the build uses what is inside, but the scanner cannot read it.",
